{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/cf687e366f82a540d84c8432390977af.webp?t=1769753302\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're mysterious labyrinths found all over the world that have existed for longer than recorded history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with treasures and monsters, each dungeon has drawn countless to its gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek fame, and others seek fortune. Adventurers traverse their depths day and night, and many don't make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The danger does nothing to keep people away. As people continued to flock to the dungeons, towns were eventually built and developed around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was all long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even today, many mysteries remain. A young man visits the town in hopes of unraveling some of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/ec3695afd4f33d55e0364f39a095ac33.webp?t=1769753302\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/21cd7575a123e19257dfa8a3e6a14697.avif?t=1769753302\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer ever-changing, mysterious dungeons!<br>Delve deeper while facing a series of randomly-selected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/94e40c703006f25871a80b8e6e34d699.webp?t=1769753302\" width=12 height=19 /></span><strong>\u00a0Action Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Points are spent when you trigger events or engage in battles within the dungeon. If you run out of Action Points and press forward, you will take damage.<br>You can recover Action Points by using certain items or through specific events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/360d9ae8b918a97a73067ec88312bf43.webp?t=1769753302\" width=15 height=19 /></span><strong>\u00a0Corruption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the dungeon, you'll gradually acquire more Corruption. If Corruption exceeds a certain level, you will encounter the &quot;Demon of the Dungeon.&quot;<br>Additionally, during dice rolls, roughly 10% of your current Corruption is deducted from the result.<br>Certain events can reduce Corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item has a set weight.<br>If you exceed the weight limit, you will be unable to act.<br>To avoid this, regularly store items in the deposit box in your room or sell/discard unnecessary items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Days</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A day passes when you rest at the inn or fall in the dungeon.The game will end on the morning of the 16th day.<br>You must also make payments to the guild every five days, so be sure not to miss them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Rolls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success or failure in dungeon events is determined by a dice roll.<br>You can increase your Luck using equipment, improving your rolls and giving yourself an advantage in exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/b50156d76795e902d6345de71e3d186e.webp?t=1769753302\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/eb7d6fa4ae9eb108a94670e4d04b774c.avif?t=1769753302\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your relationship with our heroine, Monica!<br>Strengthen your bond with Monica to unlock every special event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/98dda63010af3a9c19bfbbc2b7e53ca8.webp?t=1769753302\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/b5d85b2d65fa1cd6ecfee5a9e88c0320.avif?t=1769753302\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/extras/04d96395c6135dd1ed4fce6f03aa829b.avif?t=1769753302\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603530?t=1769753302","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603530?t=1769753302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/67e617772c43d73589977ef870a9d1a93d660755/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769753302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603530/67e617772c43d73589977ef870a9d1a93d660755/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769753302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{